begin="1:35.329" end="1:35.793">繋</span><span begin="1:35.793" end="1:36.065">げ</span><span begin="1:36.065" end="1:36.225">な</span><span begin="1:36.225" end="1:36.529">い</span><span begin="1:36.529" end="1:36.753">手</span><span begin="1:36.753" end="1:37.016">が</span><span begin="1:37.016" end="1:37.400">も</span><span begin="1:37.400" end="1:37.931">ど</span><span begin="1:37.931" end="1:38.328">か</span><span begin="1:38.328" end="1:38.528">し</span><span begin="1:38.528" end="1:38.891">い</span></p><p begin="1:39.229" end="1:42.822" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.229" end="1:39.434">目</span><span begin="1:39.434" end="1:39.627">が</span><span begin="1:39.627" end="1:39.869">合</span><span begin="1:39.869" end="1:40.122">う</span><span begin="1:40.122" end="1:40.587">度</span><span begin="1:40.587" end="1:41.082">に</span> <span begin="1:41.082" end="1:41.546">高</span><span begin="1:41.546" end="1:41.837">鳴</span><span begin="1:41.837" end="1:42.074">る</span><span begin="1:42.074" end="1:42.558">胸</span><span begin="1:42.558" end="1:42.822">を</span></p><p begin="1:43.095" end="1:45.655" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.095" end="1:43.318">止</span><span begin="1:43.318" end="1:43.574">め</span><span begin="1:43.574" end="1:43.711">よ</span><span begin="1:43.711" end="1:43.848">う</span><span begin="1:43.849" end="1:44.150">と</span><span begin="1:44.150" end="1:44.279">し</span><span begin="1:44.279" end="1:44.554">て</span><span begin="1:44.554" end="1:45.655">る</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="1:46.710" end="1:53.749" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.710" end="1:47.415">雪</span><span begin="1:47.415" end="1:48.506">が</span> <span begin="1:48.506" end="1:48.726">ハ</span><span begin="1:48.726" end="1:49.095">ラ</span><span begin="1:49.095" end="1:49.415">ハ</span><span begin="1:49.415" end="1:50.614">ラ</span> <span begin="1:50.614" end="1:51.015">落</span><span begin="1:51.015" end="1:51.686">ち</span><s